# Tapped In — AI router

Production code is the **repo root only**. Scaffold was removed 2026-05-17 — do not recreate `tapped-in-scaffold/`.

Before implementing:

1. Read `INTEGRATION_STATUS.md` for migration status
2. Read `docs/feature-registry.yaml` for the feature ID (paths, storage, collisions)
